    <preface>
      <p>Family Assistance Legislation Amendment (Child Care Subsidy) Act 2023</p>
      <p>No. 38, 2023</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to family assistance, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
